	'notes_h' => 'Notes from the round',
	'pg_about_i' => 'Shikii Mats was founded in 2014. The round still runs from the same kind of place it started: a depot, a van, and a mat laid inside the door before opening.',
	'pg_about_s1_b1' => 'Mara Okafor founded Shikii Mats in 2014. The work was the same as it is now. A clean entrance mat goes down inside the door, and a fresh one replaces it every four weeks, so the site never has to maintain it. The company is based at the depot, Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. From there the fitters leave on the round, Monday to Saturday, with installs starting at 06:30.',
	'pg_about_s1_b2' => 'The desk opens at 07:00. Nothing in the way we hire mats depends on a contract. A site can start with one trial month, keep the size, resize, or stop, and stopping carries no fee. The people who run that round are named below. They are the ones who answer, measure, lay, swap, wash and inspect.',
	'pg_about_s1_h' => 'Founded in 2014',
	'pg_about_s2_b1' => 'The depot is Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. Mats come back here on the van after a swap. They are washed and inspected, then hung on rails until they go out again. The loading door is where the round starts in the morning. Liesel Brandt runs wash and inspection. The fitters load fresh mats and unload used ones. The customer desk is in the same building. Desk hours are Monday to Friday 07:00 to 17:00 and Saturday 07:00 to 12:00.',
	'pg_about_s2_b2' => 'Sunday the depot is closed. The round does not run on Sunday. Phone the desk on +00 20 7000 4410, or email round@shikiimats.example. If you are booking an install, the fitter still needs the site address and postcode, the doorway width in centimetres, and a preferred date. The depot itself is not a showroom. Visits to a site happen at the site.',
	'pg_about_s2_h' => 'The depot',
	'pg_about_s3_b1' => 'Mara Okafor is the founder. She set the company up in 2014 and still works from the depot at Canal Yard. Tomas Lindqvist is round lead. He sets the Monday-to-Saturday round and keeps install times from 06:30. Priya Raman is a fitter. She measures doorways and lays and swaps mats on site. Jonah Weiss is a fitter and does the same work: about 20 minutes for an install, and the week-four swap when the mat is due.',
	'pg_about_s3_b2' => 'Liesel Brandt runs wash and inspection. Used mats come to her at the depot and go back out only after they have been washed and checked. Ana Ferreira is the customer desk. She takes trial bookings, extra swap visits, size changes and notes for the round. Six people, one depot, one round. For a booking, Ana is the person who writes back.',
	'pg_about_s3_h' => 'People on the round',
	'pg_about_s4_b1' => 'The company was founded in 2014 by Mara Okafor. The depot is Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton, and the round still leaves from that loading door. Hire is one mat at a time, on a four-week swap, for offices, shops, clinics and showrooms. The trial month is the way a new site starts: one 85 × 150 cm mat, install and one swap, at €19. After that the price is the price of the size on the floor.',
	'pg_about_s4_b2' => 'There is no contract, and there is no fee to stop. Wash and inspection stay at the depot, with Liesel Brandt. The fitters are Priya Raman and Jonah Weiss. Tomas Lindqvist leads the round. Ana Ferreira answers the desk in the hours posted above. That is the shape of the company. Dates, prices and names used here are the ones we trade on.',
	'pg_about_s4_h' => 'How the company is set up',
	'pg_about_t' => 'About',
	'pg_book_a_trial_i' => 'Book one site for a month. We measure and lay an 85 × 150 cm mat, then swap it once. The trial month is €19. After that the standard price is €24 every four weeks, unless you resize or stop.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s1_b1' => 'Install day starts on the round, from 06:30, Monday to Saturday. The fitter arrives with the mat and a tape. The doorway is measured in centimetres. The mat is unrolled just inside the door, on the dry side of the sill, with the street left outside. A standard trial mat is 85 × 150 cm. The visit takes about 20 minutes. You do not need to move furniture for a parade of fittings.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s1_b2' => 'One measure, one mat, one place. The fitter notes the site and leaves the mat down. You do not wash it and you do not take it up at night. The next planned visit is the swap four weeks later. If the date you asked for is free, the customer desk confirms it. The next free install we are offering is Tuesday at 06:30. Write if you need a different morning.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s1_h' => 'What happens on install day',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s2_b1' => 'The trial is one site and one month. Week one is the install: measure, lay the mat, leave it. Weeks two and three the mat stays in place and does its work at the door. There is no mid-month visit unless you book an extra swap. Week four is the swap. The fitter takes the used mat and lays a fresh one. That pair of visits, install plus one swap, is the €19 trial on one 85 × 150 cm mat.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s2_b2' => 'Included in the month: the install and measure, the one swap visit, wash and inspection at the depot, a size change if the first size is wrong, no contract, and the right to stop any time. An extra swap on a wet week is €12 and is not part of the €19. After the month you can keep the standard mat at €24 every four weeks, move to another size, or stop. Stopping carries no fee.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s2_h' => 'The trial month',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s3_b1' => 'Use the form on this page, or email round@shikiimats.example. The note we need is short. Your name. The business name. The site type: office, shop, clinic, showroom or other. The site address and postcode. The doorway width in centimetres if you know it. The fitter will measure again on the day. A preferred install date. Your email. A phone number if you want a call. A message if the door is awkward, if you need the Tuesday 06:30 slot, or if you want a size other than 85 × 150 cm from the start.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s3_b2' => 'If the form on the site is not available, the mailto button opens your email to round@shikiimats.example. Sending that message is the booking request. Ana Ferreira at the customer desk reads it in desk hours: Monday to Friday 07:00 to 17:00, Saturday 07:00 to 12:00.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s3_h' => 'What to send with the booking',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s4_b1' => 'You stop. There is no fee and no contract to unwind. Tell the customer desk before the next swap and the fitter will collect the mat instead of laying another. You can also stop part-way by saying so. The trial month is priced as install plus one swap. If you have had the install and do not want the swap, say so and the desk will close the site.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s4_b2' => 'If you want to keep the mat but change size, say the size: standard 85 × 150 cm at €24, large 115 × 180 cm at €34, lobby 150 × 240 cm at €52, or logo mat 85 × 150 cm at €39, each per four weeks. The fitter brings that size at the next swap.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s4_h' => 'What if we need to stop after the month?',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s5_b1' => 'Yes. Installs start at 06:30 so the mat is down before you open. The round runs Monday to Saturday. It does not run on Sunday, and the depot desk is closed that day. The next free install is Tuesday at 06:30. If Tuesday is wrong for the site, give another morning in the booking note.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s5_b2' => 'The visit is about 20 minutes. Someone does not have to watch for the whole round afterwards. Week four is the only planned return in the trial month. Phone +00 20 7000 4410 if you would rather book by voice. Ask for the customer desk.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s5_h' => 'Can the install be before we open?',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s6_b1' => 'The used mat goes to the depot at Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. Liesel Brandt washes it and inspects it. It hangs on the rails until it is ready for another site. It is not left in your store, your lobby or your clinic. You are not asked to clean it first.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s6_b2' => 'On a wet week the same path applies to an extra swap: the fitter carries the wet mat out, lays a dry one, and the depot does the rest. That extra visit is €12. The trial swap in week four is already inside the €19.',
	'pg_book_a_trial_s6_h' => 'What happens to the mat we take off?',
	'pg_book_a_trial_t' => 'Book a trial install',
	'pg_contact_i' => 'The depot is Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. Phone +00 20 7000 4410 or email round@shikiimats.example. Ana Ferreira answers the customer desk.',
	'pg_contact_s1_b1' => 'Write or call the depot at Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. The phone is +00 20 7000 4410. The email is round@shikiimats.example. Desk hours are Monday to Friday 07:00 to 17:00 and Saturday 07:00 to 12:00. Sunday the desk is closed. The round is separate from desk hours. Fitters are out Monday to Saturday, and installs start at 06:30, before the desk opens. If you need a mat down before you open, book the install at 06:30 rather than waiting for the desk.',
	'pg_contact_s1_b2' => 'The loading door is for the round, not a public counter for browsing mats. If you want to see which size you need, send the doorway width in centimetres with the site address. Priya Raman or Jonah Weiss will measure it again when they lay the mat. Wash and inspection stay inside the depot with Liesel Brandt.',
	'pg_contact_s1_h' => 'Depot and hours',
	'pg_contact_s2_b1' => 'Ana Ferreira books trial installs, ongoing rounds, size changes and extra swap visits. A trial is one site for one month at €19 for one 85 × 150 cm mat, install plus one swap. Ongoing prices are €24, €34, €52 or €39 every four weeks, by size, and an extra wet-week swap is €12. She can also take a stop. There is no fee to stop and no contract to cancel.',
	'pg_contact_s2_b2' => 'Tell her the business name, the site type and the address. Site types are office, shop, clinic, showroom or other. Preferred install date helps. The next free install is Tuesday at 06:30. Tomas Lindqvist leads the round those bookings go onto. Mara Okafor founded the company in 2014. You do not need to reach her to book a mat.',
	'pg_contact_s2_h' => 'What the desk can book',
	'pg_contact_s3_b1' => 'The form on this page sends a message to the customer desk. If it is not available, use the email button. It opens your own email app addressed to round@shikiimats.example. Write the subject in your own words, or use a clear line such as trial install, extra swap, or round notes. Include a phone number if you want a call during desk hours. We read the site address and postcode, the doorway width if you have it, and the preferred date.',
	'pg_contact_s3_b2' => 'We do not need photographs to book. We do not need payment on this page. The first paid piece of work is the trial month or the size you agree with the desk. For early word of new districts on the round, use the round notes page. That list is separate from a booking. Joining it does not reserve an install.',
	'pg_contact_s3_h' => 'Email and the form',
	'pg_contact_t' => 'Contact',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_i' => 'Four mats are on the hire list. Each one is laid inside the door and swapped every four weeks. The fitter measures the doorway on install day.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s1_b1' => 'The standard mat is 85 × 150 cm. It is the size used for the trial month: one mat, the install, and one swap visit, at €19 for that month. After the trial the same size is €24 every four weeks. It suits a single shop door, a clinic entrance or a modest office door where the sill is narrow. The mat is charcoal and lies flat just inside the glass, with the outside pavement on the other side of the threshold.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s1_b2' => 'It stays down for weeks one, two and three. In week four the fitter swaps it. You do not shake it, wash it or store it. Care sits with the depot. If the measured doorway needs more cover, the size can be changed. During the trial a size change is included. After that you can resize or stop with no fee.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s1_h' => 'Standard 85 × 150 cm',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s2_b1' => 'The large mat is 115 × 180 cm and is €34 every four weeks. It is for a wider shop entrance, a clinic door with more footfall across the sill, or an office door that the standard mat does not cover. The fitter measures the doorway width in centimetres before the mat is laid, and the install still takes about 20 minutes. The four-week round is the same as for the standard mat. The mat is in place from the install or the last swap, it works through the middle weeks, and week four is the swap.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s2_b2' => 'An extra swap in a wet week is €12 on this size as on the others. The trial month itself is offered on one 85 × 150 cm mat. If you want to begin on the large size, say so when you book and the desk will price the ongoing round at €34 every four weeks.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s2_h' => 'Large 115 × 180 cm',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s3_b1' => 'The lobby mat is 150 × 240 cm and is €52 every four weeks. It is the wide mat for an office lobby, a showroom entrance or any doorway where a narrower mat would leave floor on either side. It is laid inside the door, on the dry side of the sill, and it follows the same four-week round. Week four is the swap. The fitter rolls the used lobby mat into the van and lays a fresh one.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s3_b2' => 'Wash and inspection are at the depot. Because the mat is large, the measure on install day matters: doorway width in centimetres, and a look at how the door swings or turns. The visit is still about 20 minutes and still starts from 06:30 on the round. There is no separate contract for the lobby size. You can keep it, resize down, or stop, and stopping carries no fee.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s3_h' => 'Lobby 150 × 240 cm',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s4_b1' => 'The logo mat is 85 × 150 cm, the same size as the standard mat, at €39 every four weeks. It is for a site that wants its own mark on the mat at the door. The round does not change for it. The mat is laid inside the entrance, left in place for four weeks, and swapped in week four for a fresh logo mat. Wash and inspection happen at the depot between hires.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s4_b2' => 'The trial month price of €19 applies to one plain 85 × 150 cm mat with install and one swap, not to the logo mat. If you want a logo mat from the first install, book it at the logo price and tell the desk when you write. Doorway width, site type and preferred install date are enough to start. We do not ask you to clean or store the logo mat between swaps.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s4_h' => 'Logo mat 85 × 150 cm',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s5_b1' => 'You do not maintain the mat. That is the point of the round. Leave it where the fitter laid it, just inside the door. Do not fold it away at night, and do not wash it on site. Water, grit and shoe-prints are what it is there to hold until the swap. In week four the used mat leaves in the van. At Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton, it is washed and inspected, then hung ready to go out again.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s5_b2' => 'If a wet week loads the mat early, book an extra swap at €12 rather than trying to dry it yourself. If the mat no longer matches the doorway, ask for a size change at the next swap. The sizes you can move between are the standard, the large, the lobby and the logo mat. Stop any time. There is no fee to stop.',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_s5_h' => 'Care between swaps',
	'pg_mats_and_sizes_t' => 'Mats and sizes',
	'pg_prices_i' => 'Prices are per mat, per four-week round. The trial month is one site: one 85 × 150 cm mat, the install, and one swap visit.',
	'pg_prices_s1_b1' => 'Trial month — one 85 × 150 cm mat, install plus one swap: €19. Standard 85 × 150 cm: €24 every four weeks. Large 115 × 180 cm: €34 every four weeks. Lobby 150 × 240 cm: €52 every four weeks. Logo mat 85 × 150 cm: €39 every four weeks. Extra swap visit for wet weeks: €12. The trial is one month at one site. After that month the mat continues at the standard price for its size unless you resize or stop.',
	'pg_prices_s1_b2' => 'Stopping carries no fee. There is no contract. Installs take about 20 minutes and start at 06:30. Rounds run Monday to Saturday. These figures are the same on the home page, on this page and on the booking page. A size change during the trial month is included. The extra swap is the only additional visit price on the list.',
	'pg_prices_s1_h' => 'Price list',
	'pg_prices_s2_b1' => 'Each price covers the mat on the floor and the round that keeps it fresh. The fitter brings the mat, measures the doorway, and lays it inside the door. About 20 minutes is the install. Four weeks later the fitter swaps it. The used mat is washed and inspected at the depot at Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton, before it is hired again. You do not pay a separate wash fee. You do not buy the mat.',
	'pg_prices_s2_b2' => 'Between the install and the week-four swap the mat simply stays down. The trial month includes the install, one swap visit, wash and inspection, a size change if you need one, no contract, and the right to stop any time. After the trial, wash and inspection and the four-week swap stay in the size price. The customer desk confirms what you have booked before the fitter comes.',
	'pg_prices_s2_h' => 'What is included',
	'pg_prices_s3_b1' => 'A wet week can fill a mat before the planned swap. The extra swap visit is €12. The fitter comes, lifts the wet mat, lays a fresh one, and takes the used mat back for wash and inspection. The visit is the same kind of early call as the rest of the round, starting from 06:30, Monday to Saturday. It does not add a contract and it does not carry a stop fee.',
	'pg_prices_s3_b2' => 'Your four-week cycle continues. Week four is still the planned swap unless you ask to stop or to change size at that visit. Book the extra swap through the customer desk if rain has loaded the entrance and you do not want to wait. One extra visit is one mat. A second mat at the same site is priced on its own row.',
	'pg_prices_s3_h' => 'Extra swap visit',
	'pg_prices_s4_b1' => 'Hire runs with no contract. You book a trial, you try one site for a month, and then you keep the round, resize, or stop. There is no fee to stop. There is no minimum number of swaps after the trial month. The trial itself is install plus one swap, priced at €19 for one 85 × 150 cm mat. If you continue, you pay the four-week price for the size on the floor: €24, €34, €52 or €39 for the logo mat.',
	'pg_prices_s4_b2' => 'You can move between those sizes. Say so before the next swap and the fitter brings the size you asked for. Invoices follow the round. Questions on a price go to Ana Ferreira at the customer desk, by phone on +00 20 7000 4410 or by email at round@shikiimats.example. The desk is open Monday to Friday 07:00 to 17:00 and Saturday 07:00 to 12:00.',
	'pg_prices_s4_h' => 'No contract',
	'pg_prices_t' => 'Prices',
	'pg_privacy_i' => 'This note says what Shikii Mats does with the details you send when you book a mat or ask to join round notes. It is the practice of one depot, Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton.',
	'pg_privacy_s1_b1' => 'A trial booking or a contact message may include your name, your business name, the site type, the site address and postcode, the doorway width in centimetres, a preferred install date, your email, your phone number and a message. Site type is one of office, shop, clinic, showroom or other. Round notes ask for an email address only. You choose what to write. We use those details to answer, to book an install, to run the four-week round, to arrange a size change or an extra swap, or to send the round note you asked for.',
	'pg_privacy_s1_b2' => 'We do not buy address lists. We do not ask for card numbers on these pages. Payment is arranged with the customer desk after a booking is agreed. The phone we publish is +00 20 7000 4410 and the email is round@shikiimats.example.',
	'pg_privacy_s1_h' => 'What you send us',
	'pg_privacy_s2_b1' => 'Messages come to the customer desk. Ana Ferreira reads bookings and round-note requests during desk hours. Tomas Lindqvist, the round lead, sees the site address, the doorway and the install date so the fitter can attend. Priya Raman and Jonah Weiss see what they need on the day: where to go, which mat to lay, how wide the door is. Liesel Brandt does not need your email to wash a mat.',
	'pg_privacy_s2_b2' => 'Mara Okafor founded the company in 2014 and can see the same records. We do not publish your message, your phone number or your email on the site. Named stories already on the site, Northgate Offices, Hearth & Crumb and Easton Dental, use only the contact names we were given to publish: Daniel Mensah, Sofia Marin and Dr. Lena Kowalski.',
	'pg_privacy_s2_h' => 'Who reads them',
	'pg_privacy_s3_b1' => 'If you send a round-notes request, we use that email to write when a new district opens on the round. A form that opens your email app does not add you by itself. You are not on the list until the message is sent. You can ask to leave the list by emailing round@shikiimats.example. You can also ask what we hold about your site, ask us to correct it, or ask us to stop using it for the round.',
	'pg_privacy_s3_b2' => 'Stopping the mail does not by itself stop a mat that is already on the floor. Say if you want both. Desk hours for these requests are Monday to Friday 07:00 to 17:00 and Saturday 07:00 to 12:00. Sunday the depot is closed. We keep a booking for as long as the site is on the round and as needed to answer a question about it.',
	'pg_privacy_s3_h' => 'Notes, email and stopping',
	'pg_privacy_t' => 'Privacy',
	'pg_round_notes_i' => 'Round notes are for people who want early word when the round opens a new district. Leaving your email does not subscribe you until you send the message.',
	'pg_round_notes_s1_b1' => 'The round runs Monday to Saturday from the depot at Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. When we add a district, we tell the round notes list first, before we take new trial installs there. A note is an email. It says where the round is opening and how to book a trial if you want one. It is not a bill and it is not a contract. You can be on the list and never book a mat.',
	'pg_round_notes_s1_b2' => 'You can book a mat and never join the list. Trial installs that are already available stay on the booking page. The next free install we are publishing is Tuesday at 06:30, at the trial price of €19 for one site, one month, one 85 × 150 cm mat. Round notes do not change that price and do not hold that slot.',
	'pg_round_notes_s1_h' => 'Early word on new districts',
	'pg_round_notes_s2_b1' => 'Use the form on this page. Enter your email and send it. If no form plugin is running, the form opens your email app so you can send the request yourself to round@shikiimats.example. The notice beside that path is exact: opens your email app. Send the request to join the round notes; you are not subscribed yet. Nothing is added to a list until that message is sent. We ask for an email address only on this page.',
	'pg_round_notes_s2_b2' => 'A booking still needs the longer note: name, business name, site type, address and postcode, and a preferred date. Ana Ferreira reads both kinds of message during desk hours, Monday to Friday 07:00 to 17:00 and Saturday 07:00 to 12:00. To leave the list, email the same address and say you want to stop the notes. There is no fee.',
	'pg_round_notes_s2_h' => 'How to join',
	'pg_round_notes_s3_b1' => 'Round notes are not the four-week swap and they are not an invoice. They do not confirm an install. They do not promise a date in a district we have not opened. They do not replace the phone. For a mat this month, book a trial install or call +00 20 7000 4410. Prices in any note are the same prices as on the price list: trial €19, then €24, €34, €52 or €39 every four weeks by size, and €12 for an extra swap.',
	'pg_round_notes_s3_b2' => 'We do not add offers in the notes that are not on that list. Stories from sites already on the round may appear as posts. Those posts sit on the news page. They describe the work. They are not a claim about results at your door.',
	'pg_round_notes_s3_h' => 'What the notes are not',
	'pg_round_notes_t' => 'Round notes',
	'pg_sites_i' => 'Shikii Mats hires entrance mats to offices, shops, clinics and showrooms. A fitter lays the mat inside the door, and a fresh one replaces it every four weeks.',
	'pg_sites_s1_b1' => 'An office lobby picks up grit from the street before anyone reaches the carpet. We lay the mat on the inside of the glass or revolving door, on the dry side of the sill, so the first steps of the day land on pile. Office sites on the round use the standard 85 × 150 cm mat, or the lobby mat at 150 × 240 cm when the opening is wide. Priya Raman or Jonah Weiss measures the doorway on install day.',
	'pg_sites_s1_b2' => 'The visit takes about 20 minutes, and installs start at 06:30 so the mat is down before staff arrive. The mat then stays for the four-week round. It works through weeks one, two and three. In week four the fitter swaps it for a fresh mat and takes the used one back to the depot. Northgate Offices lobby is on this round. Daniel Mensah, facilities, keeps the visits to the early slot.',
	'pg_sites_s1_h' => 'Offices',
	'pg_sites_s2_b1' => 'A shop doorway meets wet pavement, shoe-prints and the first customer of the morning. The mat goes down inside the door before you open. Small boutiques on the round usually take the standard 85 × 150 cm mat. A deeper entrance can take the large mat at 115 × 180 cm. Both sit on the same four-week round: in place for three weeks, swapped in week four.',
	'pg_sites_s2_b2' => 'Hearth & Crumb, the bakery, is one of these shop sites. Sofia Marin, the owner, has a mat just inside the door onto a wet street. On a wet week she can add an extra swap visit. The round itself does not change. Rounds run Monday to Saturday, and the fitter collects the used mat in a plain van at the swap.',
	'pg_sites_s2_h' => 'Shops',
	'pg_sites_s3_b1' => 'A clinic entrance should feel calm when patients come in from the street. The mat lies inside the reception door and takes water and grit off shoes before the floor. Clinic sites use the standard 85 × 150 cm mat or the large 115 × 180 cm mat, measured to the doorway on install day. The install takes about 20 minutes. After that the mat is on a four-week round, with one swap visit in week four.',
	'pg_sites_s3_b2' => 'Easton Dental is on the round. Dr. Lena Kowalski keeps a mat at the clinic entrance so patients step off the pavement onto a clean pile. The trial month covers one site: the install and one swap visit. Wash and inspection happen at the depot, not on the clinic floor. You do not maintain the mat between visits.',
	'pg_sites_s3_h' => 'Clinics',
	'pg_sites_s4_b1' => 'A showroom entrance opens onto a polished floor, and the mat is there to stop the street at the sill. Showroom sites on the round use a wide mat, often the lobby size at 150 × 240 cm, or the large size at 115 × 180 cm where the door is narrower. The fitter measures the doorway in centimetres at the install and lays the mat just inside the glass. The same four-week track applies.',
	'pg_sites_s4_b2' => 'The mat stays down for weeks one, two and three. Week four is the swap: the used mat is rolled out, a fresh mat goes down, and the visit is still built around the early round. There is no contract on any site type. You can keep the size, resize, or stop, and stopping carries no fee. Site types we book are office, shop, clinic, showroom and other.',
	'pg_sites_s4_h' => 'Showrooms',
	'pg_sites_t' => 'Sites we serve',
	'pg_terms_i' => 'These terms cover entrance-mat hire from Shikii Mats, depot at Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. They match the prices and the round published on this site.',
	'pg_terms_s1_b1' => 'We hire mats. We do not sell the mat on these terms. A mat is laid inside your door and swapped every four weeks. The install takes about 20 minutes. Installs start at 06:30. Rounds run Monday to Saturday and do not run on Sunday. You leave the mat in place between visits. You do not wash it and you do not store it. Wash and inspection are at our depot. The trial is one site for one month: one 85 × 150 cm mat, the install and one swap visit, at €19.',
	'pg_terms_s1_b2' => 'After the trial, if you keep that size, the price is €24 every four weeks. Other sizes are large 115 × 180 cm at €34, lobby 150 × 240 cm at €52, and logo mat 85 × 150 cm at €39, each per four weeks. An extra swap visit in a wet week is €12.',
	'pg_terms_s1_h' => 'The hire',
	'pg_terms_s2_b1' => 'There is no contract. You may keep the mat on the round, resize it, or stop. Stopping carries no fee. Tell the customer desk before the next swap if you want the fitter to collect the mat and not lay another. A size change during the trial month is included. After the trial, resizing means the next swap brings the size you named, at that size’s price. If you stop part-way through a trial month, tell Ana Ferreira and she will close the site.',
	'pg_terms_s2_b2' => 'The four steps we work to are: book a trial, measure and install, swap in week four, then keep, resize or stop. Nothing in these terms adds a minimum number of months, a notice period measured in days, or a penalty. Desk hours are Monday to Friday 07:00 to 17:00 and Saturday 07:00 to 12:00.',
	'pg_terms_s2_h' => 'No contract, and how to stop',
	'pg_terms_s3_b1' => 'You provide a doorway we can measure and a few minutes at the start of the day for the install or the swap. The fitter lays the mat just inside the door. If nobody can open the door, the visit waits for another morning on the round. An extra visit you ask for because the week is wet is the €12 extra swap, not a second trial. We bring the mat, swap it and take the used one away.',
	'pg_terms_s3_b2' => 'We do not take on cleaning the rest of the entrance, the glass or the floor beyond the mat. The mat is there so grit and water stop at the sill. We do not state a result in numbers for any site. Stories on the site describe who is on the round. They are not a warranty.',
	'pg_terms_s3_h' => 'Visits, access and care',
	'pg_terms_s4_b1' => 'A booking request includes the name, business name, site type, site address and postcode, doorway width if known, preferred install date, email and phone. Site types are office, shop, clinic, showroom or other. A request is confirmed when the customer desk accepts it. Email to round@shikiimats.example is a valid way to send that request. The next free install published on the site is Tuesday at 06:30.',
	'pg_terms_s4_b2' => 'If that slot is gone when we read your note, we offer another morning from 06:30, Monday to Saturday. Prices on a confirmation are the prices on the price list at the time you book. Questions about these terms go to the same desk, phone +00 20 7000 4410.',
	'pg_terms_s4_h' => 'Booking notes',
	'pg_terms_t' => 'Terms of hire',
	'pg_thanks_i' => 'Your note has reached the customer desk queue. We will read it in desk hours and reply to the email you gave.',
	'pg_thanks_s1_b1' => 'If you wrote from the booking page, we have a request for a trial install or a question about one. The trial, once confirmed, is one site for one month: an 85 × 150 cm mat, the install and one swap, at €19. After that month the standard price is €24 every four weeks unless you chose another size or asked to stop. If you wrote from the contact page, we have your message and will answer it.',
	'pg_thanks_s1_b2' => 'If you wrote to join round notes, you are on that list only because you sent the email. The form’s notice stands: sending the request is what joins you. A thanks page does not by itself confirm a slot. The next free install we publish is Tuesday at 06:30. If you asked for it, Ana Ferreira will say whether it is still open.',
	'pg_thanks_s1_h' => 'What you have sent',
	'pg_thanks_s2_b1' => 'Desk hours are Monday to Friday 07:00 to 17:00 and Saturday 07:00 to 12:00. Sunday the depot at Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton is closed, and the round does not run. If you sent the note outside those hours, it waits until the next desk morning. You do not need to send it twice. If something in the note is wrong, email round@shikiimats.example or phone +00 20 7000 4410 and correct it.',
	'pg_thanks_s2_b2' => 'Useful corrections are the site address, the doorway width and the preferred date. On install day the fitter still measures. The visit takes about 20 minutes. The mat goes down inside the door before you open, and the swap is four weeks later. There is no contract and no fee to stop. You can keep the size, resize or stop when the month ends.',
	'pg_thanks_s2_h' => 'Until we reply',
	'pg_thanks_t' => 'Thanks',
	'pg_the_round_i' => 'Every mat on the round stays down for four weeks. In week four a fitter swaps it for a fresh one and the used mat goes back to the depot at Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton.',
	'pg_the_round_s1_b1' => 'Week one begins when the mat is on the floor. On a new site that is install day: the fitter measures the doorway, lays a clean mat inside the door, and leaves. The visit takes about 20 minutes. Installs start at 06:30, before the first customer or the first member of staff. On a site that is already on the round, week one is the first week after a swap, with the fresh mat already in place.',
	'pg_the_round_s1_b2' => 'The fitter does not return that week unless you have booked something else. Tomas Lindqvist, the round lead, keeps the site on the Monday-to-Saturday round. The mat’s job that week is simple. It takes the first shoe-prints at the sill so the floor inside stays clear of the street.',
	'pg_the_round_s1_h' => 'Week one',
	'pg_the_round_s2_b1' => 'In week two the same mat stays where it was laid. There is no routine visit. The pile keeps taking grit and water at the threshold while the rest of the round runs. Fitters are out from 06:30 on other installs and on week-four swaps, Monday to Saturday. Your mat is not collected and not turned. Leaving it in place is the whole of the care you give it.',
	'pg_the_round_s2_b2' => 'If the week is unusually wet and the mat is loaded before the planned swap, you can book an extra swap visit. That visit is listed at €12. It does not reset the four-week round and it does not replace the week-four swap unless you ask to stop. Ana Ferreira on the customer desk takes the booking by phone or by email.',
	'pg_the_round_s2_h' => 'Week two',
	'pg_the_round_s3_b1' => 'Week three is the last full week of the mat on site. It is still the mat from the install or from the last swap. At the depot, Liesel Brandt prepares the replacement: wash and inspection, then a mat hung ready for the round. The fitter who will attend in week four is already on the round sheet. You do not need to be present for a mid-cycle check, because there is not one.',
	'pg_the_round_s3_b2' => 'If the doorway has changed, or you want a different size at the next swap, say so before week four. A size change is part of the trial month, and after the trial you can keep, resize or stop with no fee. The sizes on the round are 85 × 150 cm, 115 × 180 cm, 150 × 240 cm, and the logo mat at 85 × 150 cm.',
	'pg_the_round_s3_h' => 'Week three',
	'pg_the_round_s4_b1' => 'Week four is the swap. The fitter arrives on the round, rolls the used mat out and lays a fresh one in the same place inside the door. The used mat goes into the plain van and back to Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. Wash and inspection happen at the depot, in the room where mats hang on rails. Liesel Brandt checks the mat there. It is not washed on your floor and it is not left for your staff to clean.',
	'pg_the_round_s4_b2' => 'The next four weeks start from that swap. A trial month is one site and one month: the install plus this one swap visit. After the trial the standard round continues at the price for that size, every four weeks, until you resize or stop. Rounds do not run on Sunday.',
	'pg_the_round_s4_h' => 'Week four — swap',
	'pg_the_round_s5_b1' => 'Every mat that comes off a site is washed and inspected at the depot before it goes out again. The wash room is part of Unit 4, Canal Yard, Easton. Mats hang on rails after washing so they go back onto the round dry. Liesel Brandt runs wash and inspection. The fitters, Priya Raman and Jonah Weiss, bring the used mats in from the van and take fresh ones out at the start of the round.',
	'pg_the_round_s5_b2' => 'The desk is open Monday to Friday from 07:00 to 17:00 and Saturday from 07:00 to 12:00. The round itself starts earlier, at 06:30, because the mat has to be down before you open. Sunday the depot is closed and there is no round.',
	'pg_the_round_s5_h' => 'Wash and inspection at the depot',
	'pg_the_round_s6_b1' => 'Rain changes a doorway quickly. Shoe-prints and water sit on the pile, and a mat that was laid for a four-week stretch can be full before week four. On those weeks you can book an extra swap visit at €12. The fitter collects the wet mat, lays a fresh one, and takes the used mat to the depot for wash and inspection.',
	'pg_the_round_s6_b2' => 'The extra visit sits alongside the round. Your next planned swap is still the week-four visit unless you decide to keep, resize or stop. Stopping carries no fee. There is no contract tying the extra visit to a longer hire. Ask the customer desk, or book it with the trial install if you already know the season at your door is wet.',
	'pg_the_round_s6_h' => 'A wet-week extra swap',
