	't4_h' => 'Size change',
	't4_p' => 'Move between 85 × 150 cm, 115 × 180 cm and 150 × 240 cm, or to a logo mat, when the doorway asks for it.',
	't5_h' => 'No contract',
	't5_p' => 'The trial month is €19 for one 85 × 150 cm mat, then the standard price if you continue.',
	't6_h' => 'Stop any time',
	't6_p' => 'Keep, resize or stop, with no fee to leave the round.',
	'th_item' => 'Item',
	'th_price' => 'Price',
	'trial_h' => 'What a trial month includes',
	'trial_p' => 'A trial month is one site and one mat: install, one swap, and a clear way to stop.',
	'trk_aria' => 'The four-week round: weeks 1 to 3 the mat stays in place, week 4 it is swapped',
	'trk_swap' => 'Swap',
	'trk_w1' => 'Wk 1',
	'trk_w2' => 'Wk 2',
	'trk_w3' => 'Wk 3',
	'trk_w4' => 'Wk 4 · swap',
	'why_h' => 'Why a mat at the door',
	'why_p1' => 'Most of the dirt in a lobby arrives on shoes. Rain, grit and pavement water sit on the pile for a few steps, then stop there instead of tracking across the floor you have just cleaned. A mat at the sill does that job only while the pile is still open. Once it is packed flat, shoes walk straight over it.',
	'why_p2' => 'Shikii Mats treats the mat as something we bring, not something you store. A fitter lays a clean charcoal mat just inside the door, notes the doorway, and leaves. Four weeks later the same round collects that mat and puts a fresh one in its place. Wash and inspection happen at the depot in Easton, not in your corridor.',
	'why_p3' => 'The trial is one site for one month: the install, then one swap visit. After that you keep the size, move up or down, or stop. There is no fee to stop. Offices, shops, clinics and showrooms sit on the same Monday-to-Saturday round, with installs starting at 06:30 so the mat is down before you open.',
	'wordmark' => 'Shikii Mats',
);
